apshot by removing dockerd and containerd pid files left by the previous container. Keep the containerd pid file while containerd is still running so live restore can reuse it.\na63b605 Merge pull request #134 from link-foundation/issue-133-b1f320d4236b\n08ae37b Revert \"Initial commit with task details\"\nd8d7c0c ci(links): ignore packages.ubuntu.com, which answers too slowly for lychee\n5792944 test(dind): reproduce the stale containerd pid and keep fresh boxes quiet\n53\n[\"in_progress\",[\"Validate measurement scripts\",\"completed\",\"success\"],[\"Measure Component Disk Space\",\"in_progress\",\"\"]]\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
