-  # and leaves the user without ~/.profile, which is the file that sources\n370-  # ~/.bashrc for an interactive *login* shell - so `su - box` and every ssh\n371-  # session would miss the PATH lines the install scripts append to ~/.bashrc.\n372-  # skel's .bashrc is deliberately not among the files copied back;\n--\n486-# version the parent resolved therefore has to be handed in explicitly at the\n487-# call site. Assert them here so an omission fails by name instead of as\n488-# \"line 128: NODE_MAJOR: unbound variable\", which is how run 33972074753 failed\n489-# on main (issue #115).\n490:: \"${NODE_MAJOR:?must be passed in by scripts/measure-disk-space.sh}\"\n491:: \"${NVM_INSTALL_VERSION:?must be passed in by scripts/measure-disk-space.sh}\"\n492:: \"${JAVA_MAJOR:?must be passed in by scripts/measure-disk-space.sh}\"\n493-\n494-# Git and tool installers must look up configuration under the box account.\n495-export XDG_CONFIG_HOME=\"$HOME/.config\"\n496-export XDG_CACHE_HOME=\"$HOME/.cache\"\n---\nbump: patch\n---\n\nKeep documentation link recovery fail-closed, preserve accurate archive diagnostics, and validate fresh disk measurements before publishing them.\n13\n[\"2026-11-12T04:46:48Z\",\"https://github.com/ocaml/dune/releases/tag/3.25.0\"]\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
