taller and renderer on the PR branch with publication disabled.', '- The [first full measurement](https://github.com/link-foundation/box/actions/runs/45954663314) reproduced the false passes. The [corrected measurement](https://github.com/link-foundation/box/actions/runs/45957697870) runs the real installer on the PR branch with publication disabled.')\ns+='- Archive target parsing: [JS #324](https://github.com/link-foundation/js-ai-driven-development-pipeline-template/issues/324), [Python #172](https://github.com/link-foundation/python-ai-driven-development-pipeline-template/issues/172), [PHP #43](https://github.com/link-foundation/php-ai-driven-development-pipeline-template/issues/43).\\\\n'\np.write_text(s)\nPY\npython3 experiments/issue-135/index-evidence.py && git diff --check && gh pr edit 136 -R link-foundation/box --body-file /tmp/box135-pr.md\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
